ine\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Last_Stand\" title=\"Last Stand\">Last Stand</a></dt><dd>During combat, when the wearer starts their turn with 50% <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> or less, they gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\">Wrath</a> for 2 turns.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-617&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;320</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thudd\" title=\"Thudd\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Thudd.png/25px-Portrait_Thudd.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Thudd.png/38px-Portrait_Thudd.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Thudd.png/50px-Portrait_Thudd.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thudd\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4